{"metadata":{"title":"The Secret Map","author":"AI","language":"English","difficulty":"A1"},"content":[["Tom has","an old map.","It is","in his room.","The map","is yellow.","Tom looks","at the map.","He sees","a big tree.","The tree","is in","the garden."],["Tom goes","to the garden.","He has","a small shovel.","The sun","is very hot.","He walks","to the tree.","The big tree","has green leaves.","Tom stops","near the trunk."],["He begins","to dig the dirt.","One meter down,","he hits","something hard.","It makes","a loud sound.","Tom smiles","very happily.","He cleans","the brown box.","It is","a metal box."],["He opens","the heavy lid.","Inside the box,","there are","shiny coins.","Tom takes","one gold coin.","He is","so excited.","He runs","into the house.","He shows","it to mom."],["Mom looks","at the coin.","She is","very surprised.","She smiles","at her son.","Tom puts","the box","under his bed.","It is","his secret treasure.","He feels","like a hero."],["The next day,","Tom looks","at the map again.","Maybe there is","another surprise.","He loves","good adventures.","The sun shines","brightly outside.","Tom is ready","for new fun."]]}